+- Remaining risks or follow-ups
+  - The API process exposes only metrics recorded in that process. Worker-only Dokploy calls use the same default collector but will need a worker metrics exposition surface if operators require direct scraping from standalone worker processes.
+- **Learnings for future iterations:**
+  - Dependency metrics should normalize private upstream paths before storage; raw Dokploy ids and query strings are not labels.
+  - Local client validation failures should not emit dependency metrics because no upstream dependency was contacted.
