+  - Added low-cardinality Dokploy dependency metrics in `internal/controlplane/telemetry`.
+  - Wired the typed Dokploy client to emit one dependency event per actual HTTP attempt, with stable error codes, retryability, latency, correlation IDs, and normalized endpoint templates.
+  - Exposed the dependency snapshot from `/metrics` under `data.dokploy_dependencies` alongside existing HTTP metrics.
+  - Documented the reusable Dokploy metric pattern in `internal/controlplane/dokploy/AGENTS.md` and the Codebase Patterns section.
+- Files changed
